{"server":"jp","storyId":"main_4_level_main_04-05_beg","groupId":"main_4","stageId":"main_04-05","title":"官僚主義","storyCode":"4-5","avgTag":"戦闘前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/jp/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_04-05_beg.txt","sourceHash":"be7f2e49cabc02498e9e2890a9a678ca0efd89d48bf4ec0a1b8cc9d4bd44b0e1","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"メテオリーテの部隊だけでなく、ほかの偵察隊もレユニオンの襲撃に遭い、通信が途切れてしまった。\nそんな中で入ったケルシーからの連絡は、龍門へ決断を迫るものだった。状況を知ったチェンも事態の緊急性を認め、アーミヤは救援任務への協力を要請した。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三十二关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_m"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"えっ……もしもし？　フロストリーフさん……！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"一体、何が――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前衛オペレーター","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"――こちら、第二偵察隊！　アーミヤさん、聞こえますか！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前衛オペレーター","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我々は現在、廃都市から撤退中です！　というのも……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前衛オペレーター","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"レユニオン……が……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前衛オペレーター","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"また、通信が……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"っ、第三偵察隊！　聞こえたら応答してください、第三偵察隊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケルシー","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"――アーミヤ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"！　ケルシー先生！　今、どこにいますか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケルシー","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"ロドス本艦のブリッジだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケルシー","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"君に頼みがあるのだが――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケルシー","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"隣にいるだろうチェン警司に、一つ聞いてみてくれないか。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケルシー","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"「龍門はいつまで下らん意地を張り続けるつもりだ？」と。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"……今の言葉、聞かなかったことにしておこう。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"とはいえ、確かにこれは一刻を争う状況だな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"報告書をお持ちしました。……おや、どうかなさいましたか？　お二人とも、随分険しい顔ですね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"――もしや、緊急の任務でしょうか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"ああ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"みなさん、準備をお願いします。すぐに出発しますので。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"――チェン隊長。この救援任務のため、我々は龍門に対し、近衛局を派遣しての協力を要請します。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"あの場所には、一時的にレユニオンの司令部もおかれているようですし――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"通信が途切れた今も、偵察隊のみなさんは、それぞれの場所で抵抗を続けているはずですから。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["アーミヤ"]},{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["チェン"]},{"speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","aliases":["ホシグマ"]}]}
